  "type": "clinical module",
  "title": "Unresponsive or abnormal breathing",
  "text": "- Shout and tap their shoulders. Do they respond?\n- If not, tilt the head back, lift the chin, and check breathing for up to 10 seconds.\n- If they are not breathing normally, call 999 on speaker, then start chest compressions.\n- Push hard and fast in the centre of the chest: 100 to 120 a minute, 5 to 6 cm deep. Let the chest come back up each time.\n- Keep going until help takes over, or they start to breathe normally.",
